{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，S01、S05这类短停留段落里，X同时铺开的感受词偏多，扫读压力明显高于Y。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X把叙事拆成可抓取的短句，并突出关键转折，观众更容易看见喜欢、害怕、收住、再放开的因果链；感受词又能随音乐段落出现，情绪细节和前后呼应都更具体。Y更轻、更容易一眼扫完，但右侧短词与左侧叙事的对应较松，部分情绪只能得到概括。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "acf09aa9-829d-4e04-bd14-b3e07709e523", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T163500369983Z", "elapsed_seconds": 119.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:36:59.806446+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "868928f8110c63008ffea162f8c6de7eef86e0f730c365706cb2292976906d63", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7